WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:10.000
[English subtitles are available]

01:31.430 --> 01:40.120
[Song of the Moon]

01:40.120 --> 01:42.990
[Episode 33]

01:43.460 --> 01:44.660
Have you ever thought

01:46.300 --> 01:47.500
maybe

01:49.289 --> 01:51.420
there is another way to break the curse

01:51.700 --> 01:54.360
other than to cleave the Four Seasons Monument?

01:54.660 --> 01:55.390
Yes, there is

01:56.620 --> 01:57.420
in the legend.

02:00.580 --> 02:01.840
But we tried it before.

02:02.900 --> 02:04.100
It didn't work at all,

02:05.540 --> 02:06.020
did it?

02:11.340 --> 02:12.200
That's because

02:14.380 --> 02:17.579
I only inherited the immortal energy of Immortal Ze Shui.

02:17.940 --> 02:19.800
I didn't inherit her resentment.

02:21.140 --> 02:23.100
No matter how I try to forgive,

02:25.540 --> 02:26.740
I just can't do it.

02:31.020 --> 02:31.980
But just now,

02:33.500 --> 02:35.700
the memory of the Brahma tree has told me

02:36.820 --> 02:38.150
as long as the inheritor

02:39.180 --> 02:40.579
becomes the Demon Queen,

02:41.980 --> 02:44.440
she will have the right to forgive the Demons

02:44.940 --> 02:47.340
and break the curse for ten thousand years.

02:56.579 --> 02:57.620
Do you remember

02:59.500 --> 03:00.090
that time

03:01.500 --> 03:02.960
I tried to break the curse?

03:04.420 --> 03:05.080
Demon King,

03:05.820 --> 03:06.620
I'm afraid...

03:07.340 --> 03:08.670
I can't break the curse.

03:09.540 --> 03:11.010
Maybe

03:11.650 --> 03:12.580
someone thinks

03:13.460 --> 03:14.740
I'm not qualified.

03:16.820 --> 03:17.620
But if

03:18.540 --> 03:19.940
I become the Demon Queen,

03:21.180 --> 03:22.140
what I carry

03:22.490 --> 03:27.040
♫The begonia is red, but every promise makes it more withered♫

03:24.250 --> 03:25.980
is the hope of the whole Demons.

03:29.150 --> 03:33.890
♫It blooms alone, but the wind and rain are more violent♫

03:30.980 --> 03:32.020
You mean

03:34.410 --> 03:40.470
♫Plants are not human beings, and ruthless fruits are planted♫

03:35.579 --> 03:38.540
you're willing to marry me and become the Demon Queen?

03:38.540 --> 03:39.340
But

03:39.340 --> 03:41.340
you and Fu have sacrificed too much.

03:41.460 --> 03:47.450
♫How can you forget the innocence and ignorance when we first met?♫

03:42.740 --> 03:44.940
As long as that lunatic who is locked up

03:46.579 --> 03:48.180
would be able to

03:48.910 --> 03:53.750
♫The butterfly emerges from the chrysalis, but it is difficult to fly to the sky♫

03:49.020 --> 03:50.260
to be free

03:52.980 --> 03:55.320
and those people who would die without water

03:55.320 --> 04:00.440
♫The butterfly's wings were broken, and the dream fell without a trace♫

03:55.700 --> 03:57.420
can be saved.

04:00.730 --> 04:06.790
♫Because of their greed for the warmth of fire, they lost each other♫

04:01.300 --> 04:02.260
Have you ever

04:02.260 --> 04:04.100
thought about Fu's feelings?

04:06.140 --> 04:07.700
He has committed so many sins.

04:07.200 --> 04:13.940
♫There is a period of youth, and he is waiting for the spring breeze in the coming year♫

04:09.540 --> 04:11.670
Has he ever thought about my feelings?

04:13.540 --> 04:15.200
After I become the Demon Queen

04:15.420 --> 04:16.550
and break the curse,

04:16.820 --> 04:18.540
Fu won't risk his life

04:17.209 --> 04:20.260
♫How many times do we have to reincarnate♫

04:18.980 --> 04:21.019
and it will end

04:20.430 --> 04:23.210
♫Before we meet again in the next life?♫

04:22.820 --> 04:24.060
all these disputes.

04:23.810 --> 04:26.350
♫Suffer all grief and long hate♫

04:25.180 --> 04:26.780
Compared to these,

04:26.350 --> 04:29.940
♫Reversed right and wrong dreams♫

04:27.140 --> 04:28.540
our love hardly matters.

04:29.540 --> 04:30.300
What about you?

04:30.300 --> 04:32.890
♫I exiled my thousand-year-old body♫

04:32.860 --> 04:33.659
Do you dare to do it?

04:32.890 --> 04:37.320
♫Waiting for the ashes to slowly burn in the heart♫

04:37.320 --> 04:43.920
♫Wait until the end of life to see the begonia turn red again♫

04:38.460 --> 04:39.420
Let me out!

04:40.380 --> 04:41.340
Let me out!

04:42.700 --> 04:43.900
I want to see Luo Ning!

04:48.420 --> 04:48.950
Brother.

04:49.300 --> 04:49.860
Fu.

04:51.580 --> 04:52.460
How is Luo Ning?

04:57.130 --> 04:58.180
I recalled

04:59.780 --> 05:01.910
what she heard when she hid her breath.

05:03.140 --> 05:04.140
She must hate

05:04.420 --> 05:09.260
♫The butterfly emerges from the chrysalis, but it is difficult to fly to the sky♫

05:05.180 --> 05:06.740
every word I said.

05:08.500 --> 05:10.260
If I don't explain to her,

05:10.260 --> 05:10.820
she might never

05:10.820 --> 05:12.140
want to see me again.

05:10.840 --> 05:15.950
♫The butterfly's wings were broken, and the dream fell without a trace♫

05:15.300 --> 05:16.620
What can you tell her?

05:16.240 --> 05:22.300
♫Because of their greed for the warmth of fire, they lost each other♫

05:18.660 --> 05:20.920
Tell her that you never did those things.

05:21.100 --> 05:22.330
Or you never make

05:22.710 --> 05:29.450
♫There is a period of youth, and he is waiting for the spring breeze in the coming year♫

05:24.300 --> 05:25.780
those plans?

05:29.220 --> 05:29.900
I know.

05:31.940 --> 05:32.659
What I did

05:32.730 --> 05:35.770
♫How many times do we have to reincarnate♫

05:34.180 --> 05:35.510
is all wrong in her eyes.

05:35.940 --> 05:38.720
♫Before we meet again in the next life?♫

05:37.940 --> 05:39.320
Is everything I did wrong

05:39.320 --> 05:41.860
♫Suffer all grief and long hate♫

05:39.900 --> 05:41.820
in your eyes?

05:41.860 --> 05:45.450
♫Reversed right and wrong dreams♫

05:45.810 --> 05:48.400
♫I exiled my thousand-year-old body♫

05:48.400 --> 05:52.840
♫Waiting for the ashes to slowly burn in the heart♫

05:49.450 --> 05:50.220
Fu,

05:52.840 --> 05:59.130
♫Wait until the end of life to see the begonia turn red again♫

05:53.100 --> 05:55.630
I've been indulging you too much these years.

05:59.130 --> 06:02.430
♫I'm willing to spread my wings♫

06:02.430 --> 06:05.560
♫And don't fight the fate♫

06:05.560 --> 06:15.320
♫It's a good moment to share the world with you♫

06:15.580 --> 06:16.110
Brother.

06:23.620 --> 06:24.090
Fu,

06:25.500 --> 06:26.620
I'm sorry.

06:28.090 --> 06:29.700
I hope when you come out,

06:31.180 --> 06:32.780
the curse of the Aquatic Demons

06:32.780 --> 06:33.710
would be broken.

06:35.060 --> 06:37.120
You won't need to be bothered anymore

06:37.740 --> 06:39.180
and you can live well.

06:43.740 --> 06:44.659
You two

06:45.040 --> 06:47.570
♫How many times do we have to reincarnate♫

06:46.860 --> 06:48.180
are willing to

06:48.370 --> 06:51.480
♫Before we meet again in the next life?♫

06:49.940 --> 06:51.900
see me be imprisoned here for 100 years.

06:51.700 --> 06:54.250
♫Suffer all grief and long hate♫

06:54.250 --> 06:58.659
♫Reversed right and wrong dreams♫

06:58.659 --> 07:02.010
♫I exiled my thousand-year-old body♫

07:02.030 --> 07:05.440
♫Waiting for the ashes to slowly burn in the heart♫

07:05.440 --> 07:12.200
♫Wait until the end of life to see the begonia turn red again♫

07:23.100 --> 07:23.830
You're back.

07:24.810 --> 07:25.340
Brother.

07:26.140 --> 07:27.340
When did you get here?

07:30.420 --> 07:31.680
I've been here all day.

07:33.650 --> 07:34.659
I just want to see

07:35.460 --> 07:36.790
when you will come back.

07:38.300 --> 07:40.370
I went out for a while.

07:41.260 --> 07:42.460
Something happened.

07:43.090 --> 07:44.180
I was injured.

07:44.700 --> 07:45.900
Luckily, I was saved.

07:59.290 --> 08:00.620
You were badly injured.

08:01.060 --> 08:01.790
Who hurt you?

08:05.140 --> 08:06.340
The one who hurt me...

08:07.460 --> 08:08.420
The one who hurt me

08:08.420 --> 08:10.880
has been punished by the person who saved me.

08:11.820 --> 08:13.390
What are you talking about?

08:17.140 --> 08:19.300
All right, that's not important.

08:22.100 --> 08:22.740
Well,

08:23.540 --> 08:24.940
if the person who saved me

08:25.500 --> 08:27.210
is talented and kind,

08:28.180 --> 08:29.500
can I marry him?

08:30.810 --> 08:31.340
Luo Ning,

08:32.620 --> 08:34.260
I just want you to find

08:34.260 --> 08:35.460
a kind and decent man.

08:35.659 --> 08:37.120
As long as he's not a demon,

08:37.220 --> 08:38.220
I will ask no more.

08:40.620 --> 08:41.460
It looks like

08:42.130 --> 08:44.700
Luo Ning is determined to marry the Demon King.

08:44.700 --> 08:45.980
But I really don't know

08:46.380 --> 08:47.940
how you did it.

08:49.780 --> 08:50.530
That day,

08:51.220 --> 08:53.690
I knew that Wan Sui would go to the Demon Palace.

08:53.690 --> 08:54.900
So I asked you

08:55.100 --> 08:56.860
to show up in front of him.

09:01.420 --> 09:02.220
Bai Feng.

09:06.380 --> 09:07.900
Wan Sui would definitely

09:08.410 --> 09:10.340
-spread it. -They are totally different.

09:10.340 --> 09:11.870
How could they be brothers?

09:12.100 --> 09:12.820
Master.

09:16.540 --> 09:16.940
Who?

09:18.620 --> 09:20.500
Then I told

09:20.980 --> 09:22.300
Luo Ning

09:22.300 --> 09:25.180
about the Demon King and Immortal Ze Shui.

09:27.460 --> 09:30.100
I watched her grow up

09:30.340 --> 09:32.820
and I know her best.

09:32.820 --> 09:35.460
She will definitely investigate it herself.

09:36.020 --> 09:37.180
In this way,

09:38.020 --> 09:38.820
Fu

09:39.380 --> 09:41.700
will be punished by He Na.

09:42.060 --> 09:43.460
If you do this,

09:43.690 --> 09:45.140
how will he help you?

09:45.660 --> 09:47.220
He is locked up by He Na.

09:48.380 --> 09:50.100
Fu is arrogant

09:50.460 --> 09:51.860
and difficult to control.

09:51.860 --> 09:53.370
But I need someone

09:54.100 --> 09:56.820
who can help me cleave the Four Seasons Monument.

09:56.820 --> 09:58.620
He has the bloodline of the Demon King

09:58.620 --> 10:00.220
and he is the best candidate.

10:03.060 --> 10:04.380
Before that,

10:05.380 --> 10:06.460
I must

10:06.980 --> 10:08.540
curb his temper.

10:08.820 --> 10:11.150
Go to the Demon Palace and keep an eye on him

10:11.180 --> 10:13.140
and find out his movements.

10:16.580 --> 10:17.420
Then

10:18.060 --> 10:19.580
come back and report to me.

10:20.740 --> 10:21.140
Yes.

10:21.620 --> 10:22.460
Fu,

10:22.940 --> 10:25.420
I'm not afraid you won't listen to me.

10:26.660 --> 10:27.920
In the past few months,

10:28.140 --> 10:30.580
the Four Seasons Monument has been in trouble too frequently.

10:30.580 --> 10:33.040
Could it be the spy hiding in Immortal Palace

10:33.260 --> 10:34.580
doing something bad?

10:38.580 --> 10:39.300
This time,

10:39.500 --> 10:40.500
I ask you here

10:41.300 --> 10:42.660
to tell you something.

10:44.300 --> 10:45.230
Please go ahead.

10:46.140 --> 10:48.540
Xie Lingqi hid Wu Shiwei's immortal energy

10:48.940 --> 10:50.620
in the Bone Melting Pool.

10:50.620 --> 10:52.940
Besides, Wu Shiwei has been trapped in Yin-yang Cave

10:52.940 --> 10:54.140
for a thousand years.

10:54.460 --> 10:55.940
She is like a walking dead.

10:56.610 --> 10:58.940
We must investigate her immortal energy.

10:59.060 --> 11:00.740
Xie Lingqi resists

11:00.740 --> 11:02.580
the inspection and purification.

11:02.580 --> 11:04.740
Isn't that suspicious?

11:06.580 --> 11:07.330
I think

11:07.500 --> 11:08.650
Xie Lingqi

11:08.960 --> 11:11.230
is probably still doing evil deeds for the evil.

11:11.230 --> 11:12.660
He is the spy.

11:15.180 --> 11:17.190
It’s easy to prove his innocence.

11:17.280 --> 11:18.120
General Xie,

11:18.960 --> 11:22.360
all you need to do is to hand over Wu Shiwei's immortal energy.

11:22.570 --> 11:23.790
Hand it over?

11:24.500 --> 11:25.300
Why?

11:28.070 --> 11:29.270
That immortal energy

11:29.630 --> 11:31.430
is the only thing Shiwei left.

11:32.060 --> 11:33.660
You are asking me to hand it over?

11:33.660 --> 11:34.860
Why don't you kill me?

11:35.250 --> 11:37.110
I believe Xie Lingqi is innocent.

11:39.030 --> 11:41.680
The Four Seasons Monument has been in trouble several times.

11:41.680 --> 11:43.440
It might be the evil spirit

11:43.440 --> 11:45.250
in the immortal energy.

11:45.250 --> 11:46.130
But

11:47.430 --> 11:49.160
do you have any solid evidence?

11:50.670 --> 11:51.380
Ge,

11:51.680 --> 11:52.940
a leopard can't change

11:53.230 --> 11:54.530
its spots.

11:55.040 --> 11:56.880
Don't be indecisive.

11:58.190 --> 11:59.190
Xie Lingqi can't do

11:59.190 --> 12:00.120
this damage.

12:00.540 --> 12:01.540
Immortal Master,

12:02.220 --> 12:03.270
I've checked

12:03.430 --> 12:05.200
the damage to the Four Seasons Monument.

12:05.200 --> 12:07.130
It has nothing to do with him.

12:07.590 --> 12:09.310
General Xie is innocent.

12:13.180 --> 12:14.580
The evil is very cunning.

12:15.910 --> 12:18.910
He makes us suspect each other and makes people panic.

12:18.970 --> 12:20.500
That's what he wants to see.

12:21.490 --> 12:22.590
Don't panic.

12:22.880 --> 12:23.510
Yes.

12:44.640 --> 12:45.480
Shiwei,

12:47.660 --> 12:49.340
I will become the senior

12:49.340 --> 12:50.310
in your heart,

12:51.690 --> 12:52.530
right?

13:00.760 --> 13:02.360
I know you didn't do it.

13:03.030 --> 13:05.640
But I need you to pretend to be imprisoned

13:06.900 --> 13:08.110
to help me find

13:09.040 --> 13:11.170
the spy hiding in the Immortal Palace.

13:13.620 --> 13:15.760
I will protect the Immortal Palace.

13:23.110 --> 13:23.950
Immortal,

13:24.330 --> 13:26.630
someone has been coming in and going out the Xiyin Mountain recently.

13:26.630 --> 13:27.680
Maybe the spy

13:27.680 --> 13:29.010
is taking action again.

13:30.790 --> 13:33.100
The situation is getting more dangerous.

13:33.100 --> 13:34.030
Liu Shao,

13:34.530 --> 13:35.870
every progress you make

13:36.130 --> 13:38.060
is our chip to succeed.

13:59.770 --> 14:00.770
What do you think?

14:01.120 --> 14:01.830
Am I good?

14:03.170 --> 14:03.720
Not bad.

14:04.310 --> 14:06.700
What do you mean by that? Praise me.

14:07.460 --> 14:08.720
You've improved a lot.

14:12.250 --> 14:13.880
Last time I saw Luo Ning,

14:14.560 --> 14:16.820
she seemed to have something on her mind.

14:16.910 --> 14:19.220
Should I go check on her?

14:20.270 --> 14:21.280
Okay.

14:31.650 --> 14:33.080
Your brother said you have something on your mind.

14:33.080 --> 14:34.170
I came to see you.

14:38.500 --> 14:39.250
Nothing.

14:40.390 --> 14:41.270
Really?

14:45.130 --> 14:45.800
Liu Shao.

14:46.640 --> 14:47.690
Do you know?

14:48.110 --> 14:50.710
I saw it with my own eyes in the Demon Palace that

14:51.510 --> 14:53.310
the people of the Aquatic Demons

14:53.400 --> 14:55.250
died in front of me.

14:56.970 --> 14:58.100
It was so miserable.

14:58.950 --> 15:00.080
I don't want to see

15:01.760 --> 15:03.400
it happen again.

15:04.870 --> 15:06.510
I can end all of this.

15:07.140 --> 15:09.570
I'm the inheritor of the Immortal Ze Shui's immortal energy.

15:09.570 --> 15:11.040
I can break this curse.

15:13.020 --> 15:13.730
So,

15:15.240 --> 15:16.710
I want to marry He Na.

15:21.500 --> 15:22.170
Luo Ning.

15:22.680 --> 15:23.390
Luo Ning.

15:26.500 --> 15:28.010
When did you know

15:28.980 --> 15:31.310
you're the inheritor of Immortal Ze Shui?

15:37.500 --> 15:38.960
The moment I found out that

15:39.860 --> 15:41.120
I can summon

15:42.040 --> 15:44.040
and activate Bone-Corroding Harp.

15:57.120 --> 15:57.960
Since young,

15:58.920 --> 16:00.650
you asked me to copy scriptures

16:01.190 --> 16:04.590
and forbid me to touch anything related to the demonic world.

16:04.720 --> 16:05.560
I guess

16:06.780 --> 16:08.160
that's the reason.

16:10.180 --> 16:11.310
Since you know it,

16:12.700 --> 16:14.040
you should know

16:14.670 --> 16:17.950
what happened between the Demon King and Ze Shui ten thousand years ago.

16:17.950 --> 16:19.120
I will never agree to

16:19.540 --> 16:21.100
this marriage.

16:22.740 --> 16:25.760
But this marriage is not a loss to me.

16:27.020 --> 16:27.820
Brother,

16:28.320 --> 16:31.390
you are the only one who loves me.

16:32.140 --> 16:33.470
But it's different now.

16:34.030 --> 16:35.250
Now there's He Na.

16:36.390 --> 16:38.190
He won't interfere with my life.

16:38.650 --> 16:40.040
My life

16:40.040 --> 16:42.220
will be more free

16:42.390 --> 16:43.270
and more noble.

16:45.040 --> 16:45.970
Isn't that good?

16:46.300 --> 16:47.220
Luo Ning,

16:48.060 --> 16:50.290
the curse of the Aquatic Demons has nothing to do with you.

16:50.290 --> 16:53.100
The Three Realms shouldn't be your responsibility.

16:53.100 --> 16:54.990
You should find someone you love

16:55.580 --> 16:57.180
to spend your life together.

17:11.369 --> 17:12.300
I can't.

17:14.230 --> 17:15.190
What did you say?

17:16.369 --> 17:17.380
I said

17:18.640 --> 17:19.650
I can't find him.

17:22.420 --> 17:24.099
The person I used to like

17:25.270 --> 17:27.460
has been kicked to hell by me.

17:30.440 --> 17:31.450
I even closed

17:31.450 --> 17:32.920
his coffin tightly.

17:34.010 --> 17:35.770
He will never come out again.

17:36.240 --> 17:37.450
I will never

17:38.630 --> 17:39.590
let him hurt

17:39.590 --> 17:41.050
the people I love the most.

17:41.530 --> 17:42.370
You mean...

17:43.750 --> 17:44.720
Fu?

17:46.270 --> 17:47.740
Did Fu do something to you?

17:48.710 --> 17:50.440
Brother, stop mentioning him.

17:51.900 --> 17:53.360
I just want you to know that

17:54.130 --> 17:55.730
I will become the Demon Queen

17:56.860 --> 17:59.260
and break the curse for the Aquatic Demons.

18:00.340 --> 18:01.480
I promise

18:01.940 --> 18:03.580
I will live a happy life.

18:05.380 --> 18:07.020
Please help me.

18:07.610 --> 18:08.110
No.

18:11.720 --> 18:13.320
I can't let you sacrifice your happiness

18:13.320 --> 18:14.540
for a curse.

18:15.210 --> 18:16.550
So what?

18:17.390 --> 18:18.740
If you don't agree,

18:18.740 --> 18:20.000
I'll marry him anyway.

18:20.670 --> 18:22.060
If you lock me up,

18:22.560 --> 18:24.370
I'll get rid of Ze Shui's immortal energy

18:24.370 --> 18:25.880
and drown myself in this pond.

18:25.880 --> 18:26.280
You...

18:33.480 --> 18:34.530
Immortal Luo Ge.

18:34.530 --> 18:36.170
Immortal Master Wanwu said something happened to the Four Seasons Monument.

18:36.170 --> 18:37.260
Please go over.

18:39.040 --> 18:46.220
♫The remaining flowers in the mirror reflect the moon in the water♫

18:47.490 --> 18:52.140
♫We can't live up to such a good time♫

18:53.190 --> 18:59.670
♫Recalling the unforgettable glance at the beginning♫

18:56.200 --> 18:56.830
Luo Ning,

18:58.970 --> 19:00.740
are you really going to sacrifice your life

19:00.200 --> 19:03.740
♫I realized that it was a thousand years ago♫

19:00.740 --> 19:01.870
for a curse?

19:03.740 --> 19:06.800
♫Is this bad luck, or good luck?♫

19:06.660 --> 19:08.210
This curse of thousands of years

19:06.800 --> 19:10.420
♫He said that responsibility and love are difficult to balance♫

19:09.980 --> 19:11.570
has driven so many people crazy.

19:10.420 --> 19:13.250
♫He had no choice but to leave me♫

19:13.210 --> 19:14.510
I'm just

19:13.940 --> 19:17.490
♫The past has passed, so do not linger♫

19:17.410 --> 19:18.960
one of them.

19:17.490 --> 19:20.200
♫My love for you is still so strong♫

19:20.830 --> 19:24.520
♫Too many intertwined oaths and lies♫

19:24.520 --> 19:28.080
♫Have shattered my dreams♫

19:28.080 --> 19:36.020
♫Who would like to take a broken willow branch and watch the moon alone in the blue sky♫

19:36.440 --> 19:39.890
♫Life is like a grain of sand♫

19:39.890 --> 19:43.320
♫It burns the fire in my heart♫

19:43.510 --> 19:51.340
♫I want to burn myself to hear you say you have never changed♫

19:47.650 --> 19:48.990
In this world

19:49.920 --> 19:51.050
everything

19:51.470 --> 19:53.190
have to choose their own fate.

19:54.540 --> 19:55.710
I thought

19:56.300 --> 19:59.070
I was a carefree fairy in the Xiyin Mountain.

19:59.070 --> 20:01.130
I don't need to think about anything.

20:01.260 --> 20:02.310
But in the end,

20:02.770 --> 20:04.320
we have to move forward

20:05.080 --> 20:06.630
and make our own choices.

20:06.640 --> 20:10.350
♫Why have you been so far away from me every time♫

20:08.610 --> 20:10.200
I hope everything I do

20:10.350 --> 20:13.480
♫For billions of years♫

20:11.340 --> 20:13.020
can remove his inner demon

20:13.680 --> 20:17.470
♫Can I use your hands to warm up the world again?♫

20:14.240 --> 20:16.130
and let him live again.

20:17.470 --> 20:20.480
♫A few hasty nights♫

20:17.680 --> 20:19.190
Do you think

20:19.700 --> 20:20.870
the person in front of you

20:20.790 --> 20:24.500
♫Too many intertwined oaths and lies♫

20:21.080 --> 20:22.800
is not the one who made you laugh

20:22.800 --> 20:23.940
and played with you?

20:23.940 --> 20:25.030
I am

20:24.500 --> 20:27.980
♫Have shattered my dreams♫

20:26.200 --> 20:27.630
the real Fu now.

20:27.980 --> 20:38.430
♫Who would like to take a broken willow branch and watch the moon alone in the blue sky♫

20:28.680 --> 20:30.990
Since this is caused by Ze Shui,

20:32.670 --> 20:34.230
let me end it.

20:38.800 --> 20:39.810
Your Majesty,

20:39.940 --> 20:41.870
could the curse of the Demons

20:41.870 --> 20:43.510
be broken this time?

20:46.780 --> 20:47.790
Yes.

20:49.930 --> 20:51.790
I'm going to the Immortal Palace.

20:52.660 --> 20:54.550
Will Immortal Luo Ge

20:54.850 --> 20:56.490
agree?

20:59.260 --> 21:00.660
Whether he agrees or not,

21:01.950 --> 21:03.420
I have to

21:04.680 --> 21:06.610
discuss it with him in advance.

21:07.830 --> 21:09.340
And I have to say goodbye

21:13.330 --> 21:14.880
to Liu Shao.

21:40.460 --> 21:41.260
Miss Liu Shao.

21:41.720 --> 21:42.520
My name is Kho.

21:42.810 --> 21:43.740
It's your demon.

21:44.200 --> 21:45.210
My demon?

21:45.500 --> 21:46.340
Kho?

21:49.660 --> 21:50.720
Don't hit my demon!

21:52.600 --> 21:53.600
This is my demon.

21:53.600 --> 21:54.400
How can I hand him over?

21:54.400 --> 21:54.950
No.

21:55.330 --> 21:56.420
Your demon?

21:57.260 --> 21:59.060
You're so beautiful and kind.

22:02.510 --> 22:05.700
You don't talk much

22:05.910 --> 22:06.970
every time you lie.

22:07.550 --> 22:10.210
And you will tilt your head to the left like this.

22:10.530 --> 22:12.790
People could see you through at a glance.

22:18.590 --> 22:19.790
If you don't fight for

22:20.400 --> 22:21.620
some things,

22:22.120 --> 22:23.550
you will never get it.

22:23.970 --> 22:24.730
From now on,

22:25.480 --> 22:26.410
I will try my best

22:27.120 --> 22:28.340
to get what I want,

22:28.760 --> 22:31.160
no matter it's for the survival of my people

22:34.050 --> 22:35.770
or the people I care about.

22:37.870 --> 22:38.800
You mean Fu?

22:39.260 --> 22:39.800
And you.

22:42.830 --> 22:45.770
My Demon Palace still lacks a Demon Queen.

22:46.780 --> 22:47.780
He Na...

22:48.460 --> 22:49.040
I...

22:50.980 --> 22:51.780
Just kidding.

22:52.280 --> 22:53.280
Anyway, remember

22:53.870 --> 22:54.870
you are not alone.

22:55.130 --> 22:56.730
At least in the Demon Palace,

22:59.210 --> 23:00.760
I will be by your side.

23:07.780 --> 23:08.700
From now on,

23:09.960 --> 23:10.970
I'm no longer

23:12.400 --> 23:13.860
your demon.

23:49.270 --> 23:50.150
Fairy Luo Ning,

23:51.620 --> 23:53.300
I will go to Palace Chonghua

23:54.350 --> 23:56.330
to propose the marriage to your brother.

23:56.330 --> 23:57.750
You are quite decisive

23:58.130 --> 23:58.970
this time.

24:04.940 --> 24:05.570
I'm sorry.

24:06.870 --> 24:09.000
This is only about the Aquatic Demons,

24:09.430 --> 24:11.230
but it involves your happiness.

24:11.570 --> 24:13.080
It's unfair

24:15.390 --> 24:16.920
and even despicable to you.

24:20.520 --> 24:22.250
The curse of the Aquatic Demons

24:23.080 --> 24:25.480
was originally caused by Immortal Ze Shui.

24:25.640 --> 24:26.360
Since

24:26.400 --> 24:28.250
I inherited the immortal energy of Immortal Ze Shui,

24:28.250 --> 24:28.960
I should

24:28.960 --> 24:30.470
end it.

24:32.570 --> 24:33.540
Besides,

24:34.380 --> 24:35.470
the Aquatic Demons

24:35.890 --> 24:37.400
have been punished for ten thousand years.

24:37.400 --> 24:39.710
I shouldn't let this hatred continue.

24:40.800 --> 24:41.850
You and Fu

24:42.990 --> 24:44.410
should have a different life.

24:44.410 --> 24:45.250
Fu.

24:52.940 --> 24:55.080
Fu is too obsessed with hatred.

24:55.960 --> 24:57.390
He deserved it.

24:58.230 --> 24:59.450
And as his brother,

25:01.000 --> 25:02.660
I didn't take good care of him.

25:04.830 --> 25:05.760
He treats you...

25:06.930 --> 25:08.530
Since I've decided to let go,

25:08.690 --> 25:09.690
I won't regret it.

25:11.250 --> 25:12.720
All my decisions

25:13.180 --> 25:14.710
have nothing to do with him.

25:16.500 --> 25:17.430
This marriage is

25:17.930 --> 25:19.260
just to break the curse.

25:19.780 --> 25:20.450
I am the Demon King.

25:20.450 --> 25:21.290
It's my duty.

25:21.960 --> 25:24.960
But you were the happiest fairy in the Xiyin Mountain.

25:26.620 --> 25:28.080
After the curse is broken,

25:28.640 --> 25:30.030
it will just be the title

25:30.190 --> 25:31.450
of Demon Queen.

25:31.750 --> 25:32.590
I can still be

25:32.590 --> 25:34.020
the happiest fairy.

25:35.020 --> 25:36.070
Besides, I think

25:37.040 --> 25:39.570
you won't stop me from going anywhere freely.

25:44.390 --> 25:46.150
Demon Palace and Immortal Palace.

25:46.150 --> 25:47.750
You can go anywhere you want.

25:48.670 --> 25:49.930
No matter where you go,

25:50.650 --> 25:51.950
whether you want to

25:51.990 --> 25:53.650
keep the title of Demon Queen,

25:54.510 --> 25:56.770
in the heart of me and the Aquatic Demons,

25:58.120 --> 25:59.010
Fairy Luo Ning

26:00.430 --> 26:02.890
will be always the most respectable person.

26:04.340 --> 26:05.070
We will never

26:06.820 --> 26:08.030
forget it.

26:38.270 --> 26:39.800
Luo Ning wants to marry you.

26:39.950 --> 26:41.000
Is that true?

26:43.020 --> 26:44.320
You know it?

26:44.990 --> 26:45.750
Luo Ning

26:47.260 --> 26:48.350
told me.

26:52.760 --> 26:55.490
Are you blaming me for being selfish and having an ulterior motive

26:55.490 --> 26:57.380
to marry Luo Ning?

26:58.140 --> 27:00.670
I know you've been thinking about your people

27:01.210 --> 27:03.610
and your responsibility as the Demon King.

27:04.820 --> 27:05.660
But...

27:06.330 --> 27:08.530
It's the Demon King's responsibility,

27:09.190 --> 27:10.530
not He Na's.

27:12.210 --> 27:14.690
He Na is a boy in white who can't lie.

27:17.210 --> 27:18.930
He would do anything

27:20.150 --> 27:22.080
for his friends.

27:23.130 --> 27:25.100
What about him?

27:36.270 --> 27:37.450
I once thought

27:38.420 --> 27:39.630
to follow my heart.

27:40.770 --> 27:42.660
But seeing the girl I like

27:43.250 --> 27:44.800
having a better future,

27:45.980 --> 27:47.110
I feel relieved.

27:48.200 --> 27:50.400
I can't just think about the girl I like.

27:51.480 --> 27:52.190
Now,

27:53.870 --> 27:55.470
I can only be the Demon King.

28:03.030 --> 28:05.490
Since I've taken the honor of the Demon King,

28:05.840 --> 28:09.100
I'm destined to take the responsibility of the Demon King.

28:09.410 --> 28:10.340
There are

28:11.340 --> 28:13.190
countless people behind me

28:13.910 --> 28:16.370
who have been longing for sunlight and land.

28:16.550 --> 28:19.320
There are thousands of people who yearn for a happy family

28:19.320 --> 28:20.580
like me.

28:23.650 --> 28:26.450
If I can exchange thousands of people's happiness

28:26.930 --> 28:28.480
with my unhappy marriage,

28:31.210 --> 28:32.410
I think it's worth it.

28:32.550 --> 28:32.970
He Na.

28:34.280 --> 28:34.860
Liu Shao.

28:44.900 --> 28:45.660
Thank you.

28:47.380 --> 28:51.960
♫I want to get close but I can't see clearly♫

28:52.680 --> 28:57.250
♫Who arranged this rain?♫

28:58.360 --> 29:02.880
♫I want to avoid but I meet you again♫

28:58.550 --> 28:59.880
I can't give the pendant

29:01.360 --> 29:03.170
to you.

29:03.510 --> 29:08.210
♫I can't help but stay with you♫

29:09.390 --> 29:13.840
♫The stars call the morning sky♫

29:14.510 --> 29:19.000
♫May you feel relieved♫

29:20.260 --> 29:24.800
♫I long for a hug♫

29:20.390 --> 29:20.990
Thank you.

29:24.760 --> 29:26.350
Thank you for letting me meet you.

29:25.350 --> 29:30.600
♫Can I not just listen?♫

29:31.270 --> 29:34.710
♫I want to find our way through destiny♫

29:35.300 --> 29:40.930
♫I want to throw away the memory in exchange for you to come back♫

29:41.350 --> 29:46.220
♫Raise the glass to reincarnate the world♫

29:46.510 --> 29:51.850
♫I'll wait for your response with no regrets♫

29:52.940 --> 29:56.600
♫I'll find the promised home for you♫

29:57.100 --> 30:02.680
♫My heart aches and I will say yes again♫

30:03.100 --> 30:08.480
♫When will we separate?♫

30:08.650 --> 30:16.420
♫Please don't tell us our ending in advance♫

30:26.500 --> 30:27.130
Wow.

30:27.290 --> 30:28.850
Demon King spent a lot.

30:28.850 --> 30:29.690
Of course.

30:29.690 --> 30:31.240
Otherwise, how can he marry our fairy?

30:31.240 --> 30:32.880
What do you think is inside?

30:32.880 --> 30:35.080
It must be something you've never seen.

30:44.390 --> 30:45.920
Take back what you brought.

30:46.700 --> 30:48.030
Or we'll not be friends.

30:57.110 --> 30:57.700
Luo Ge,

30:59.470 --> 31:01.400
I sincerely want to marry Luo Ning.

31:04.670 --> 31:06.940
The person you care about is not Luo Ning.

31:11.060 --> 31:12.280
Maybe not now.

31:14.040 --> 31:15.040
But in the future,

31:15.800 --> 31:17.270
the person I care about

31:17.400 --> 31:18.450
is Luo Ning.

31:24.500 --> 31:25.000
Luo Ge,

31:27.020 --> 31:28.080
please believe me.

31:28.400 --> 31:28.990
I will protect her

31:28.990 --> 31:30.380
and treat her as my life.

31:30.500 --> 31:32.600
I will try my best to make her happy for the rest of her life.

31:32.600 --> 31:33.700
Her happiness

31:35.380 --> 31:36.760
is to spend her life

31:36.760 --> 31:37.960
with her beloved one.

31:39.570 --> 31:41.840
There shouldn't be any schemes.

31:44.110 --> 31:44.660
He Na,

31:46.380 --> 31:49.440
I always respect you for being a gentleman in the demons.

31:49.440 --> 31:51.970
But what you are doing now is not gentlemanly.

31:53.770 --> 31:55.700
You think I'm scheming against her?

31:55.700 --> 31:56.540
Am I wrong?

31:58.520 --> 31:59.780
Luo Ning is a kind girl.

32:00.990 --> 32:03.890
She has been trying to break the curse of your people.

32:03.890 --> 32:05.220
I don't care about that.

32:06.080 --> 32:07.940
I don't even mind helping you out.

32:09.140 --> 32:12.870
But this is not the reason to sacrifice my sister's life happiness.

32:16.580 --> 32:18.510
If there is any other possibility,

32:21.740 --> 32:23.250
I would rather fill myself in

32:23.250 --> 32:24.260
to block the curse

32:25.730 --> 32:27.730
and don't want to implicate others.

32:28.000 --> 32:29.340
Then fill yourself in.

32:29.810 --> 32:31.340
Don't implicate my sister.

32:40.850 --> 32:41.400
He Na.

32:42.280 --> 32:44.170
I don't mind you counting me in

32:45.600 --> 32:47.060
when you fill yourself in.

32:52.280 --> 32:53.810
But please let my sister go.

32:55.800 --> 32:56.560
Luo Ge,

33:02.860 --> 33:04.540
why don't you ask Luo Ning

33:06.430 --> 33:07.980
about her thoughts?

33:23.730 --> 33:26.670
You've been strict with Luo Ning

33:27.260 --> 33:29.570
because you're worried that she'll follow Immortal Ze Shui's path.

33:29.570 --> 33:30.750
It's all my fault.

33:32.050 --> 33:33.710
If I could protect her better,

33:35.410 --> 33:36.870
I might be able to avoid her

33:37.970 --> 33:39.170
getting on this path.

33:41.830 --> 33:43.510
This wouldn't have happened.

33:44.560 --> 33:47.290
Actually, I've talked to He Na.

33:47.710 --> 33:49.510
He's totally different from Fu.

33:49.900 --> 33:52.330
He won't be impulsive and cruel

33:52.960 --> 33:55.620
just like the Demon King ten thousand years ago.

33:56.320 --> 33:58.890
I think he can take good care of Luo Ning.

33:59.980 --> 34:02.080
Don't worry too much about that.

34:09.719 --> 34:12.070
I know He Na's character too.

34:14.639 --> 34:15.520
I just hope

34:17.620 --> 34:19.020
she can be happy forever.

34:26.560 --> 34:27.190
Luo Ge,

34:27.570 --> 34:30.380
are you really not going to attend Luo Ning's wedding?

34:30.380 --> 34:31.730
That's the Demon King in White,

34:31.730 --> 34:32.900
not the Demon King.

34:33.909 --> 34:34.580
What if

34:34.920 --> 34:36.010
Luo Ning cries?

34:36.350 --> 34:37.400
What will she do?

34:45.340 --> 34:47.020
It's the most important day for Luo Ning

34:47.020 --> 34:48.650
and she can't see her brother.

34:48.650 --> 34:49.750
Poor thing.

35:12.130 --> 35:13.930
Just copy the Meditation Spell.

35:15.070 --> 35:16.400
Don't do anything evil.

35:17.630 --> 35:18.980
Do good deeds.

35:20.360 --> 35:22.170
Get rid of all evil ideas

35:24.020 --> 35:25.610
and eliminate the sins.

35:27.880 --> 35:29.440
Didn't you just promise me

35:30.190 --> 35:32.590
to kill those who hurt me?

35:35.060 --> 35:35.780
Now,

35:39.770 --> 35:42.170
it's just a hundred years of imprisonment.

35:44.560 --> 35:45.620
Even if I was wrong,

35:48.290 --> 35:49.640
even if I failed you,

35:50.940 --> 35:52.830
are you really so cruel?

35:55.010 --> 35:55.940
A hundred years.

35:58.500 --> 36:00.960
Can you bear not to see me for a hundred years?

36:40.080 --> 36:40.750
Luo Ge,

36:44.950 --> 36:46.340
I'm sorry.

36:46.590 --> 36:47.790
You can be sorry to me,

36:50.030 --> 36:51.760
but you can't let Luo Ning down.

36:56.540 --> 36:57.590
My only wish

36:59.310 --> 37:01.040
is the peace of the Three Realms

37:02.840 --> 37:04.570
and the happiness of the people

37:06.080 --> 37:08.010
even if I have to sacrifice my life.

37:10.700 --> 37:11.910
But I never thought

37:11.910 --> 37:13.840
my sister would do the same one day.

37:15.310 --> 37:16.870
I just want her to be happy

37:19.560 --> 37:20.730
in this life.

37:42.740 --> 37:43.870
Okay.

37:51.730 --> 37:54.960
I can't wait.

37:58.780 --> 38:00.670
The Demon Palace and Immortal Palace

38:00.670 --> 38:03.530
are all under my control.

38:04.030 --> 38:06.130
Soon,

38:06.510 --> 38:09.200
I'll be the master of the Three Realms.

38:35.950 --> 38:44.600
[Happiness]

39:07.070 --> 39:07.700
Mr. Tai,

39:08.540 --> 39:09.670
how is Fu these days?

39:11.780 --> 39:12.790
General Fu

39:13.000 --> 39:14.340
has been quiet lately.

39:16.310 --> 39:17.320
He made a mistake

39:18.370 --> 39:19.830
and he should be punished.

39:20.680 --> 39:22.280
It's a good thing

39:23.200 --> 39:24.860
for him to cultivate himself.

39:25.130 --> 39:26.180
But I feel guilty

39:28.830 --> 39:30.090
for marrying Luo Ning.

39:30.720 --> 39:31.560
You did it

39:32.150 --> 39:34.000
for the Aquatic Demons.

39:34.420 --> 39:35.480
I'll explain to him

39:36.390 --> 39:37.850
after the curse is broken.

39:38.450 --> 39:40.090
I hope our people

39:40.840 --> 39:43.300
will get rid of the fate of living in the water

39:43.530 --> 39:45.130
and use our race name again.

39:45.920 --> 39:46.970
Melody race.

39:47.390 --> 39:48.860
I hope you can

39:49.450 --> 39:51.340
lead us to land

39:52.270 --> 39:54.490
and revive the Melody race.

40:12.970 --> 40:13.500
Luo Ning,

40:14.520 --> 40:15.570
I did as you said.

40:17.000 --> 40:18.200
I copied scriptures.

40:19.610 --> 40:21.160
I copied many scriptures.

40:23.510 --> 40:24.910
Can you stop being angry?

40:35.610 --> 40:36.200
Mr. Tai.

40:38.170 --> 40:39.090
General Fu.

40:39.510 --> 40:40.640
Where is my brother?

40:41.820 --> 40:43.670
His Majesty is busy,

40:44.090 --> 40:45.230
so he sent me here

40:45.560 --> 40:47.910
to see if you need anything.

40:48.380 --> 40:48.750
Yes.

40:49.720 --> 40:50.920
I want to see Luo Ning.

40:52.110 --> 40:54.210
I can't decide on that.

40:54.550 --> 40:55.560
You can show the scriptures

40:55.560 --> 40:56.610
to her.

40:56.990 --> 40:58.160
She will see me.

40:58.790 --> 41:00.090
I will report it

41:00.510 --> 41:02.030
to His Majesty.

41:02.280 --> 41:04.940
Do you have to tell him about such a small matter?

41:05.010 --> 41:06.180
Do you know

41:06.560 --> 41:08.240
I may actually lose her?

41:08.910 --> 41:09.920
I can feel

41:10.510 --> 41:11.910
she's going to give me up.

41:14.420 --> 41:14.840
What?

41:16.520 --> 41:17.520
You don't want to?

41:18.990 --> 41:19.850
What happened?

41:22.690 --> 41:25.080
If there's nothing else, General Fu,

41:26.170 --> 41:27.810
I'll leave now.

41:28.570 --> 41:30.700
Is my brother really going to give me up

41:30.840 --> 41:33.100
and imprison me here for a hundred years?

41:37.600 --> 41:38.730
General Fu,

41:39.320 --> 41:41.840
His Majesty really loves you.

41:42.760 --> 41:43.390
Mr. Tai,

41:44.610 --> 41:46.670
I can't stay here for a hundred years.

41:47.340 --> 41:48.140
No way!
